<p>Ae jaan sakina naadaan sakina <br />
Ae shaam ke zindaan ki mehmaan sakina</p>

<p>Wo roz kiseli wo tera roz ka rona<br />
Bas aaj se zindaan hai sunsaan sakina</p>

<p>ye hath jo kaano'n pe ho rakkhe hue bibi<br />
Dukhte hai abhi tak kaho kya kaan sakina</p>

<p>Uth'ti nazar aati nahi ye neend hai kaisi<br />
Ye Khuab to karta hai pareshaan sakina</p>

<p>Ye des naya log naye hum bhi naye hai<br />
kis tarah se ho dafn ka saamaan sakina</p>

<p>Dekho to utho qaid me hai kis ka ye maatam<br />
baano teri is neend ke qurbaan sakina</p>

<p>Rokega nahi koi tumhei'n jaao sidhaaro<br />
Khulwaa diya hai shimr ne zindaan sakina</p>

<p>Asghar ko karo pyaar lo akber ki balaayei'n<br />
Jab quld me tum jaao meri jaan sakina</p>

<p>Do gaz ka kafan bhi tumhei'n maa'n de nahi sakti<br />
zindaan me bano hai pareshaan sakina</p>

<p>Daadi se ye kehna ke hai sab aap pa roushan<br />
jis waj'ha se hilmi hai pareshaan sakina<br />
</p>